    "body": "Non blocking - this guarantees a fixed reduction order, but requires world_size × tensor_size temporary memory and redundantly reduces the full tensor on every rank. CUDA uses one-stage or reduce-scatter + all-gather depending on size. Perhaps XPU can adopt the same pattern.",
