    "body": "Hi @sfeng33, thanks for taking the time to review this PR and for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThe current implementation prioritizes correctness and functionality, but I agree that gathering and reducing the full tensor on every rank has significant memory and computation overhead. \r\n\r\nI’m planning further batch-invariance improvements in follow-up PRs, including support for quantized models, dedicated SYCL kernels to replace the current Triton implementations where appropriate, and the more efficient collective communication patterns you suggested。\r\n\r\nI’ll take your suggestion into account in future optimizations. Since this comment is non-blocking, I’d prefer to address these performance improvements separately to keep the scope of this PR focused. Thanks again!\r\n\r\nNow that all CI checks are green, would you mind enabling auto-merge for this PR? Thanks, @sfeng33 !\r\n",
